Thu Aug 20 08:53:50 UTC 2026 - Martin Pluskal <mpluskal@suse.com>

- Recreate the Git packaging repo as sha256 so OBS scmsync
  can fetch it (the previous sha1 repo could not be synced
  from the sha256 _ObsPrj parent).
- Switch the python3-tree-sitter-elixir binding to the
  shared tree-sitter loader macros: install the grammar
  library once and generate a ctypes _binding.py instead
  of compiling the upstream C extension a second time.
- New package for Factory: Elixir grammar plus the
  python3-tree-sitter-elixir loader subpackage.
- Suggests python-tree-sitter >= 0.22 instead of Requires,
  matching tree-sitter-bash, so ring1/product installcheck
  does not demand a non-ring package.

-------------------------------------------------------------------
Mon Jul 27 08:36:23 UTC 2026 - Martin Pluskal <mpluskal@suse.com>

- Initial package of tree-sitter-elixir 0.3.5:
  * Elixir grammar library for the tree-sitter parsing
    framework (libtree-sitter-elixir.so grammar module)
  * Python binding built from the bundled bindings/python as
    pythonXYZ flavor subpackages via the shared
    %treesitter_python_build/_install macros
